This directory is tracked but its contents are not: figures/*.png and
figures/*.pdf are gitignored because they are regenerated, never hand-edited.

This placeholder exists so the directory is present on a clean checkout.
scripts/run_phase2.py writes figures/phase2_sandwich.png through an atomic
rename, which requires the parent directory to already exist; without this file
the documented reproduction recipe failed on a fresh clone at the very last
step, after the CSVs and their manifest entries had already been written.
The script also mkdir()s the directory itself -- belt and braces, since either
alone is enough and neither is expensive.
